WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night,"

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.003
and we hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.739
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.739 --> 00:00:08.975
After House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy denied reports

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:12.779
that he had planned to ask
former President Trump to resign

00:00:12.779 --> 00:00:15.181
in the wake of the capitol
attack, "The New York Times"

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:19.352
released audio of McCarthy
telling colleagues he was going

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.254
to talk to Trump
about stepping down.

00:00:21.254 --> 00:00:23.322
Alright, well, you know,
I'm sure he wouldn't lie.

00:00:23.322 --> 00:00:25.859
It was probably just a
misunderstanding. Let's hear it.

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:35.568
-Oh, alright, well,
that's pretty damning.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.337
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.372
That'd be like the
"Encanto" family saying

00:00:39.372 --> 00:00:41.641
"We always talk about Bruno."

00:00:41.641 --> 00:00:44.109
[ Laughter ]

00:00:44.109 --> 00:00:46.780
After new audio revealed that
House Minority Leader

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:50.116
Kevin McCarthy was planning to
urge former President Trump

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:51.951
to resign after
the capitol attack,

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:55.955
Trump said that he thinks it was
"A big compliment."

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:59.459
So we should just add "resign"
to the list of the words

00:00:59.459 --> 00:01:00.827
he doesn't know?

00:01:00.827 --> 00:01:01.961
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.662
"Mr. President,
you need to resign."

00:01:03.662 --> 00:01:05.532
[Imitating Trump] "Thank you,
I have been working out."

00:01:05.532 --> 00:01:07.466
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.466 --> 00:01:09.569
[Normally] Politico published
photographs on Friday

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:12.772
that appear to show Republican
Congressman Madison Cawthorn

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:14.373
wearing lingerie at a party.

00:01:14.373 --> 00:01:16.542
And I would say this is
embarrassing for him,

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:19.145
except he looks amazing.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.680
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.683
Plus, I don't think this story
will last,

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:25.918
because if you Google "Madison"
and "lingerie,"

00:01:25.918 --> 00:01:28.221
this isn't even on
the first 12 pages.

00:01:28.221 --> 00:01:29.389
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:30.823
I was told!

00:01:30.823 --> 00:01:35.094
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.094 --> 00:01:38.164
Baze, you got to tell her you
wrote that joke, Baze.

00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:42.701
If she calls the office, Baze,
you got to take credit for it.

00:01:42.701 --> 00:01:45.572
While speaking in Seattle on
Friday to commemorate Earth Day,

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:48.441
President Biden said that the
Republican Party has changed

00:01:48.441 --> 00:01:51.611
and added "This ain't your
father's Republican Party."

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:54.546
Yes. And it certainly isn't
your father's Republican Party,

00:01:54.546 --> 00:01:56.482
because they nominated Lincoln.

00:01:56.482 --> 00:01:58.851
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.851 --> 00:02:00.953
During his -- some people have
been critical, saying,

00:02:00.953 --> 00:02:03.556
"You got to stop making jokes
about how Biden's

00:02:03.556 --> 00:02:05.458
an older gentleman."

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.026
So from now on,
if you're watching the show,

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.028
we're going to say he's 32.

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:12.065
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:18.170
Problem a-solved.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.139
During his rally in Ohio
over the weekend,

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.141
former President Trump appeared
to see himself

00:02:22.141 --> 00:02:25.445
on one of the screens and said,
"What a handsome president."

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.780
Here, I think
we have some footage.

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:30.083
-Pretty bird.

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:31.617
Pretty bird.

00:02:31.617 --> 00:02:36.122
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:38.224
-At the same rally,
former President Trump said

00:02:38.224 --> 00:02:40.093
that he didn't like being called
stupid,

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:42.562
so he asked then White House
doctor Ronny Jackson

00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:44.363
to give him a test to prove
his intelligence.

00:02:44.363 --> 00:02:47.333
And this is cool --
the other side had a menu.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.369
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.369 --> 00:02:53.339
Trump also said that
water pressure regulations

00:02:53.339 --> 00:02:57.143
cause problems with the,
"third element of a bathroom,

00:02:57.143 --> 00:02:59.812
so people have to flush toilets
up to 10 times."

00:02:59.812 --> 00:03:02.615
Of course, when Trump says
he has to go number three,

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:05.184
it means he's flushing
classified documents.

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:07.053
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:09.088
[Imitating Trump]
"Mel, don't go in there!"

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.656
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.656 --> 00:03:13.959
"Do not --
A lot of call logs, Mel.

00:03:13.959 --> 00:03:15.328
'Cause I don't know how
the shredder works.

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:16.663
We've had this conversation."

00:03:16.663 --> 00:03:19.699
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.136
[Normally] A city in Michigan
yesterday appointed

00:03:24.136 --> 00:03:26.973
a cat named Jinx as the mayor
for a day.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:30.709
It was all fun and games until
Jinx signed an executive order

00:03:30.709 --> 00:03:32.979
implementing
a nightly fireworks show.

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:36.015
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:40.586
Alright, we could have gotten
a dog that looked more

00:03:40.586 --> 00:03:43.389
like a dickhead.
That is --

00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:45.925
And finally, firefighters in
Washington State last week

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:49.328
rescued a woman after she fell
headfirst into an outhouse

00:03:49.328 --> 00:03:52.464
toilet trying to retrieve her
cellphone, which is crazy,

00:03:52.464 --> 00:03:54.367
because it was an Android.

00:03:54.367 --> 00:03:55.368
[ Laughter ]

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:57.270
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

